[32m+[m[32m# AI Job Market Analyzer[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mAn AI-powered backend application for analyzing AI/ML job opportunities against a user's technical profile.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe project extracts structured information from job postings, evaluates skill compatibility, identifies skill gaps, and generates personalized recommendations.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mIt was built as a practical project for learning and demonstrating **production-oriented AI engineering, backend development, database design, testing, and containerized deployment**.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Features[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m* Analyze AI/ML job postings against a user's profile[m
[32m+[m[32m* Extract structured job information using an LLM[m
[32m+[m[32m* Calculate skill matches between a job and user profile[m
[32m+[m[32m* Identify missing or insufficient skills[m
[32m+[m[32m* Generate an AI-powered recommendation and reason to apply[m
[32m+[m[32m* Store analysis results in PostgreSQL[m
[32m+[m[32m* Retrieve previously analyzed jobs[m
[32m+[m[32m* Load user profiles from YAML[m
[32m+[m[32m* Support multiple LLM providers[m
[32m+[m[32m* Gemini as the primary LLM provider[m
[32m+[m[32m* OpenRouter as an alternative LLM provider[m
[32m+[m[32m* Automatic database migrations with Alembic[m
[32m+[m[32m* Persistent PostgreSQL storage with Docker volumes[m
[32m+[m[32m* Containerized application using Docker Compose[m
[32m+[m[32m* Unit, integration, repository, service, and API tests[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Architecture[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe application follows a layered architecture with separation between the API, business logic, domain models, persistence, and external AI providers.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32m                        ┌─────────────────┐[m
[32m+[m[32m                        │     Client      │[m
[32m+[m[32m                        └────────┬────────┘[m
[32m+[m[32m                                 │[m
[32m+[m[32m                                 ▼[m
[32m+[m[32m                        ┌─────────────────┐[m
[32m+[m[32m                        │   FastAPI API   │[m
[32m+[m[32m                        └────────┬────────┘[m
[32m+[m[32m                                 │[m
[32m+[m[32m                                 ▼[m
[32m+[m[32m                        ┌─────────────────┐[m
[32m+[m[32m                        │    Services     │[m
[32m+[m[32m                        │                 │[m
[32m+[m[32m                        │ Analysis        │[m
[32m+[m[32m                        │ Matching        │[m
[32m+[m[32m                        │ Profile         │[m
[32m+[m[32m                        │ Recommendation  │[m
[32m+[m[32m                        └───────┬─────────┘[m
[32m+[m[32m                                │[m
[32m+[m[32m                  ┌─────────────┴─────────────┐[m
[32m+[m[32m                  │                           │[m
[32m+[m[32m                  ▼                           ▼[m
[32m+[m[32m        ┌─────────────────┐         ┌─────────────────┐[m
[32m+[m[32m        │   AI Service    │         │  Repositories   │[m
[32m+[m[32m        └────────┬────────┘         └────────┬────────┘[m
[32m+[m[32m                 │                           │[m
[32m+[m[32m                 ▼                           ▼[m
[32m+[m[32m        ┌─────────────────┐         ┌─────────────────┐[m
[32m+[m[32m        │ LLM Providers   │         │   PostgreSQL    │[m
[32m+[m[32m        │                 │         │                 │[m
[32m+[m[32m        │ Gemini          │         │ SQLAlchemy      │[m
[32m+[m[32m        │ OpenRouter      │         │ Alembic         │[m
[32m+[m[32m        └─────────────────┘         └─────────────────┘[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
