[32m+[m[32m## Running with Docker[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe project includes Docker and Docker Compose configuration for running the FastAPI application together with PostgreSQL.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mStart the application:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```bash[m
[32m+[m[32mdocker compose up --build[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe container architecture is:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32m┌──────────────────────────────────┐[m
[32m+[m[32m│          Docker Compose          │[m
[32m+[m[32m│                                  │[m
[32m+[m[32m│  ┌──────────────┐                │[m
[32m+[m[32m│  │     App      │                │[m
[32m+[m[32m│  │   FastAPI    │                │[m
[32m+[m[32m│  └───────┬──────┘                │[m
[32m+[m[32m│          │                       │[m
[32m+[m[32m│          │ Docker Network        │[m
[32m+[m[32m│          ▼                       │[m
[32m+[m[32m│  ┌──────────────┐                │[m
[32m+[m[32m│  │  PostgreSQL  │                │[m
[32m+[m[32m│  └───────┬──────┘                │[m
[32m+[m[32m│          │                       │[m
[32m+[m[32m│          ▼                       │[m
[32m+[m[32m│    postgres_data                 │[m
[32m+[m[32m│       volume                     │[m
[32m+[m[32m└──────────────────────────────────┘[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Persistent Database Storage[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mPostgreSQL uses a named Docker volume:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mpostgres_data[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe volume stores the PostgreSQL data outside the database container.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mTherefore:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mContainer deleted[m
[32m+[m[32m       ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mVolume remains[m
[32m+[m[32m       ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mDatabase data remains[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mNormal container recreation does not delete the database data.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mTo intentionally remove the database volume:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```bash[m
[32m+[m[32mdocker compose down -v[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m> Be careful with `-v`: it removes the PostgreSQL volume and its stored data.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Automatic Database Migrations[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe application automatically runs:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```bash[m
[32m+[m[32malembic upgrade head[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mwhen the application container starts.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe startup flow is:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mDocker Compose starts[m
[32m+[m[32m        ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mPostgreSQL container starts[m
[32m+[m[32m        ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mPostgreSQL healthcheck[m
[32m+[m[32m        ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mPostgreSQL becomes healthy[m
[32m+[m[32m        ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mApplication container starts[m
[32m+[m[32m        ↓[m
[32m+[m[32malembic upgrade head[m
[32m+[m[32m        ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mDatabase schema is updated[m
[32m+[m[32m        ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mUvicorn starts[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mDocker Compose uses a PostgreSQL healthcheck and waits for the database service to become healthy before starting the application.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Database Migrations[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mAlembic is used to manage database schema changes.[m
